      "tag": "Find 10%",
      "h2": "10% of an amount",
      "body_html": "<p>10% means divide by 10.</p><p>10% of £80 = 80 ÷ 10 = <strong>£8</strong>.</p>"
    },
    {
      "tag": "Find 25%",
      "h2": "25% of an amount",
      "body_html": "<p>25% means divide by 4 (since 25% = 1/4).</p><p>25% of 60 = 60 ÷ 4 = <strong>15</strong>.</p>"
